  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level the acupuncturist can impart their energy into their foes without a pin thanks to their increased control over their ki. They can make acupuncture strikes with unarmed or primary natural attacks. In addition, they gain Improved Unarmed Strike as a bonus feat. Even with this feat, the acupuncturist only ever deals 1 point of non-lethal piercing damage with their acupuncture strike.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/acupuncturist-class#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
